          "end": 268.28,
          "en": "see in your phone or browser like messenger, WhatsApp.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 268.31,
          "end": 270.11,
          "en": "Those basically use private connections.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 270.11,
          "end": 276.08,
          "en": "They doesn't use use public connection no matter which application you are using.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 276.53,
          "end": 279.59000000000003,
          "en": "If you notice that you have to log in first, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 279.59000000000003,
          "end": 280.88,
          "en": "You have to create an account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 280.88,
          "end": 284.3,
          "en": "So you have to be authenticated for send someone a message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 284.3,
          "end": 288.62,
          "en": "And when you are sending a message to your friend, your friend only getting the message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 288.62,
          "end": 289.46,
          "en": "And why is that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 289.49,
          "end": 292.4,
          "en": "Why no other user is getting that message?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 292.4,
          "end": 293.93,
          "en": "Why only your friend?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 293.96,
          "end": 295.34000000000003,
          "en": "So here is the thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 295.34000000000003,
          "end": 302.04,
          "en": "It is using a private channel and you are broadcasting to that friend's Friends channel only.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 302.04,
          "end": 306.03,
          "en": "So what will happen is, let's say this is your device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
